## Task tracking

This repo tracks its own development in [`br` (beads_rust)](https://github.com/Dicklesworthstone/beads_rust), not a markdown TODO list:

```bash
br ready      # what's unblocked right now
br list       # everything, including blocked work
br show <id>  # an issue's full Behavior/Verification/State spec
```

